    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2013-2023 Mathew Groves, Chad Engler
    See src/panel/vendor/LICENSE.pixi.txt

  - pixi-live2d-display 0.4.0 (cubism2 build) — https://github.com/guansss/pixi-live2d-display
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 Guan
